tent":"這週面試了一個 Senior QA 的職缺。\n\n面試前我特別把懶人報 Lauren Tan 跟 Matt Pocock 怎麼 Code Review, 怎麼一個月 Ship 2000+ PR 的影片「二刷」\n\n真的好險有特別複習，面試中關於 AI 驗證與自動化流程，怎麼信任ＡＩ等等的問題，這兩支影片的觀念基本上就幫我回答了 8 成。剩下的 2 成，就看你有沒有真的動手應用到自己的專案。\n\n幫大家重點整理好了👇","timestamp":"2026-10-29T11:03:51.000Z","stats":{"likes":39,"replies":4,"reposts":6,"shares":22},"score":65,"first_seen":"2026-10-29T21:49:19+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfE20eKjSSr","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/DfE20eKjSSr","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"1. 核心瓶頸是「Trust」：開發速度已經不是問題，難的是你有多信任 Agent?你夠信任他，才敢放手讓他自主做事，也才能降低人介入的比率。\n\n2. 定義邊界與風險：Agent 自己 review 完沒問題，不代表真的沒問題。 要確實定義 one-way-door / two-way-door, 以及爆掉時的 Blast Radius。\n\n3. 眼見為憑 ＆ Context：不能相信 AI 說測試完成了，強制要求附上截圖或是recording，同時在 Review 時加入歷史 ticket + 相關的 bug context。\n\n4. 被拒的 PR 超級珍貴：要記錄下 Agent 開的 PR 被工程師 Reject 時留下的「Why」，是讓系統進化的關鍵。透過 Feedback Loop，繼續回饋優化Harness Quality!","timestamp":"2026-10-29T11:03:54.000Z","stats":{"likes":5,"replies":2,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":9,"first_seen":"2026-10-29T21:49:19+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfE205VjZT3","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/DfE205VjZT3","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"附上兩隻超有料精華影片：\nyoutube.com/watch…","timestamp":"2026-10-29T11:03:57.000Z","stats":{"likes":4,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":6,"first_seen":"2026-10-29T21:49:19+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfE21ZajXFc","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/DfE21ZajXFc","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"youtube.com/watch…","timestamp":"2026-10-29T11:04:01.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-10-29T21:49:19+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@darrell_tw_","posts":[{"id":"DfFIRj_n3Lx","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfFIRj_n3Lx","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"頭號外交官確定會有第五季了！","timestamp":"2026-10-29T13:36:25.000Z","stats":{"likes":